e="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>능동전압제어장치 설치에 관한 고객 동의서(특고압)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="22"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲󰠲</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="31" Style="21"><TEXT CharShape="8"><TABLE BorderFill="5" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="6" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="7"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="2122018383" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="5"><SIZE Height="54887" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="44224" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="850" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="6" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="44224"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR> 1. 고객정보(해당 분산형전원 발전자)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="7395"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>성    명</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="5" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="36829"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>§NAME§</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="7395"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>주    소 </CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="5" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="36829"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>§ADDR§</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="7395"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>발전소명</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="11337"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>§PLANT§</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="6373"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>발전용량</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="6373"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>§CAP§ kW</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="4" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="6373"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>연계전압</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="5" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="6373"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>22.9 kV</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="7395"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>연 락 처</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="5" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="36829"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>§PHONE§</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="6" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="44224"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR> 2. 동의내용</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="6" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="41999" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="44224"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="15"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>1. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>본인은 상기 분산형전원 연계를 위해 아래와 같은 전압제어장치를</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="18"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="18"><CHAR>    설치합니다.</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="16"/></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>    </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>○ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>분산형전원 능동전압제어장치(DER-AVM)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>    </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>○ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>역률제어 인버터 (모델명 : §INV_MODEL§  /  정격용량 : §INV_KW§ )</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>  2. 역률제어인버터/DER-AVM를 설치하지 않거나 설치 후 연동시험</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>    </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>결과 정상적인 동작이 안 될 시 시정이 완료 될 때까지 연계불가하며,</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>    이에 따른 불이익에 대한 책임은 본인에게 있습니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>  3. 본 분산형전원 연계는 특고압연계(22.9kV) 조건에 한하며, 추후</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>     저압(220/380V)으로 변경이 불가합니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="27" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>  4. 능동전압제어장치(DER-AVM) 하자보증기간(2년) 경과 후 연 1회 고객이 “점검표”에 의거 점검을 시행하고 그 결과를 한전 전력공급부서에 제출하지 않거나 점검 결과가 기준 만족 못할 시 분산형전원 배전계통 연계기술 기준 제20조 4항에 의거하여 완료 될 때 까지 전력 송·수전을 중지 또는 제한합니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="30" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>§DATE§</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="30" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>§PLANT§ 사업주   §SIGN§ (인)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="32" Style="22"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></SECTION></BODY><TAIL><SCRIPTCODE Type="JScript" Version="1.0"><SCRIPTHEADER></SCRIPTHEADER><SCRIPTSOURCE></SCRIPTSOURCE></SCRIPTCODE></TAIL></HWPML>